
# Student Grade Calculator

## Introduction
Student Grade Calculator is a simple web
development mini project.

## Objective
To calculate students' marks, percentage,
grades and pass/fail results automatically.

## Features
- Student name input
- Five subject marks
- Total marks calculation
- Percentage calculation
- Automatic grade calculation
- Pass or fail result

## Technologies Used
1. HTML
2. CSS
3. JavaScript

## How to Use
1. Open the website.
2. Enter student name.
3. Enter marks in five subjects.
4. Click Calculate Grade.
5. View your result.

